C-Gear Help{VAR BE01}
If you have trouble using it, touch the
“?" icon on the screen!

What is the Pokémon Storage System?{VAR BE01}
The person who developed the
Pokémon Storage System for the PC{VAR BE00}
connection is Bill in the Kanto region.

Game Sync is a system to collect save
files from Trainers all over the world{VAR BE00}
through Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection{VAR BE00}
by making Pokémon sleep and retrieving{VAR BE00}
their dreams.{VAR BE01}
Touch the Online button on the C-Gear
screen, and a button called{VAR BE00}
{VAR FF00 0001}Game Sync {VAR FF00 0000}appears.{VAR BE01}
Choose a Pokémon to send to sleep, then
you can send your save file through{VAR BE00}
Nintendo Wi-Fi Connection.{VAR BE01}
You should be able to make more Pokémon
sleep as a result of the research.{VAR BE01}

Pokémon Dreams...{VAR BE01}
If you use Game Sync to make a
Pokémon sleep, it will have dreams.{VAR BE01}
When you wake up the Pokémon with
Game Sync, its dream becomes{VAR BE00}
